### Summarize Ticket
POST http://localhost:5000/api/ai/summarize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "VPN client disconnects repeatedly during video conference calls",
    "description": "Whenever Teams or Zoom starts a meeting, Cisco AnyConnect drops with error 412. User has rebooted router twice.",
    "category": "Network"
}

### Classify Ticket Category and Priority
POST http://localhost:5000/api/ai/classify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Finance database server inaccessible after power surge",
    "description": "Entire accounting team cannot process end-of-month payroll. Critical blocker."
}

### Suggest Resolution Steps
POST http://localhost:5000/api/ai/suggest-resolution
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Outlook continuously prompting for password",
    "description": "Employee cannot open mailbox, repeated MFA prompts.",
    "category": "Email"
}

### Get Ticket Insights
GET http://localhost:5000/api/ai/insights/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
